<title>THAILAND: Thai money, forex markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money, forex markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai foreign exchange and money markets were closed on Tuesday for a mid-year bank holiday.</p>
<p>The baht finished steady on Monday at 25.80/25.90 to the dollar in the domestic market. Offshore the currency was traded at 24.80/25.10 late against 23.90/24.40 early.</p>
<p>The overnight interbank rate dropped to 13-15 percent late from 17-20 percent in the morning.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
